C. ANTI-MDS: relation min-distance d(E) vs even moment M_2 and the bound.  (proper sampler)
================================================================================================
  k=8: consec d=2  L_y=0.35823  M_2=6.12109
    d=2: max L_y=0.35823  M_2=6.12109  at [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]
